<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's producer price index falls in April.</title>
<headline>Portugal's producer price index falls in April.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's General Index of Industrial Producer Prices fell 0.4 percent to 120.9 in April, compared with the previous month, the National Statistics Institute (INE) said.</p>
<p>			     Apr 97  Mar 97  Apr 96</p>
<p>General index	    120.9   121.3   119.9</p>
<p>Monthly change	  -0.4 pct -0.5 pct</p>
<p>Yr/yr change	     0.9 pct  1.9 pct</p>
<p>Extractive industry    119.5   119.5   117.4</p>
<p>Textile industry	 117.7   117.7   117.3</p>
<p>BASE: 1993=100</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
